        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electricity, nuclear, at power plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electricity, nuclear, at power plant
Details on the two components average PWR and average BWR can be found in the respective mudules.;
UUID: 0108a517-7311-3f83-a805-e653f5bd2c89
The module represents the German nuclear mix (electricity delivered in the period 1995 - 1999) of 72% PWR and 28% BWR.
Location: Swiss data of one specific PWR and one specific BWR for requirements and German PWRs and BWRs for emissions.
Technology: Standard technology for commercial operation.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Energy statistics 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_0108a517-7311-3f83-a805-e653f5bd2c89.xml</text>
